% INVALID certificate: max x, x in [0,5] integer, has optimum 5 (solution s1), but the upper bound 4 is "proved" by
% a cutoff OBJ <= 4, which for maximization is the claim itself.
VER 1.1
VAR 1
x
INT 1
0
OBJ max
1 0 1
CON 2 0
C1 G 0 1 0 1
C2 L 5 1 0 1
RTP range -inf 4
SOL 1
s1 1 0 5
DER 1
D1 L 4 OBJ { sol } -1
